## uc-run--new

Create a new versioned run `data/<uc>/runs/v<N>/`.

- auto-pick next `v<N>` from existing `runs/` siblings
- write `run.json` = `{ date: <today>, notes? }` (id is implicit from folder)
- do NOT snapshot ground truth — it lives in `structure.json` (+ history if changed)
- do NOT pre-create per-competitor folders — created on-demand by register skill
- `bun run check` after

